# Boi canh build phai nho. Khong co file nay thi `docker build .` day 220 MB
# len daemon truoc khi chay dong RUN dau tien — phan lon la hai ban thu song
# tho trong `Bang mau/`.
#
# Anh chi can `pyproject.toml` va `src/`. Cau hinh, lich EPG va ban dump deu
# gan vao luc CHAY, khong nam trong anh.

# Neo vao goc, cung ly do nhu .gitignore: `epg/` khong neo se loai ca
# `src/vtcsi/epg/` ra khoi boi canh build.
/Bang mau/
/refs/
/build/
/epg/
/config/
.git/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tests/
*.md
.gitignore
.gitattributes
docker-compose.yml
